; ZacOS 9 icon set: original pixel art in the Mac OS 8 Platinum style.
;
; Each icon is "icon NAME SIZE" followed by SIZE rows of SIZE pixel
; characters from the palette below ("." is transparent). Compile with
; tools/icons/build_icons.py; --specimen renders a review sheet.

; Grays: a hex digit n is #nnnnnn.
color 0 000000
color 1 111111
color 2 222222
color 3 333333
color 4 444444
color 5 555555
color 6 666666
color 7 777777
color 8 888888
color 9 999999
color a AAAAAA
color b BBBBBB
color c CCCCCC
color d DDDDDD
color e EEEEEE
color f FFFFFF
; Named colors.
color K 000000
color W FFFFFF
; Lavender (the default Platinum accent): light, mid, dark, deep.
color L CCCCFF
color M 9999FF
color N 6666CC
color P 333399
color G 00BB00
color Y FFCC00
color O FF9900
color R DD0000
; The System Folder's emblems
color u DDAA66
color v 22AA44
color w 3377EE
; Zac (System Folder, Home), the doghouse
color g 442F20
color h 5B694B
color i 0F1A1D
color j 030405
color k 38070E
color m 000317
color n B7A57D
color o E1E6D1
color p DD2222
color q 991111
color r CC8844
color s 995522
color t 442200

